WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Regional source records are fictional. Identity keys and specifications remain traceable across North America, EMEA and APAC.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Candidate blocking reduces comparisons. Matching distinguishes product identity from mere fitment compatibility.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Missing part numbers require steward decisions. Contradictory hard specifications remain blocked and invalid records are quarantined.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Cluster consistency checks prevent transitive false merges. Persistent rejections and hard specifications constrain entire groups.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The clean scenario publishes forty canonical products. An unchanged replay preserves version one. Failed validation retains the prior publication.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Source, API contracts, diagrams, decisions and local evaluation are downloadable. Snowflake and Azure bindings remain unverified reference extensions.
